# Helm installation:
====================
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/helm/helm/main/scripts/get-helm-3 | bash
helm version

1. Create a Helm chart
helm create my-nginx
2. Create a Kubernetes namespace
kubectl create ns helm-nginx
3. Install the Helm chart
helm install dev_nginx . -n helm-nginx
4. List Helm releases
helm list -n helm-nginx
5. Upgrade the Helm release
helm upgrade dev-nginx . -n helm-nginx -f values.yaml
6. Check revision history
helm history dev_nginx -n helm-nginx
7. Roll back to Revision 1
helm rollback dev_nginx 1 -n helm-nginx
8. Check release status
helm status dev_nginx -n helm-nginx
